### Financial Management API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api/v1

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### TRANSACTIONS API
### ============================================

### Create Transaction - Income
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "income",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "category": "Salary",
  "description": "Monthly salary",
  "date": "2025-10-15T00:00:00Z",
  "tags": "monthly,income,salary"
}

### Create Transaction - Expense
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "category": "Food",
  "description": "Groceries",
  "date": "2025-10-19T00:00:00Z",
  "tags": "food,groceries"
}

### Get All Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions?page=1&page_size=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get All Transactions with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions?type=expense&date_from=2025-10-01&date_to=2025-10-31&sort_by=date&sort_order=desc HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Transaction by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Transaction
PUT {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 5500.00,
  "description": "Updated monthly salary"
}

### Delete Transaction
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Transactions by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/category/Food?page=1&page_size=20 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Transaction Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Transaction Summary with Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/summary?date_from=2025-10-01&date_to=2025-10-31 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Category Breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/breakdown HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Category Breakdown - Expenses Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/breakdown?type=expense&date_from=2025-10-01&date_to=2025-10-31 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Monthly Trend
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/trend?months=6 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### DAILY TARGETS API
### ============================================

### Create Daily Target
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "date": "2025-10-20T00:00:00Z",
  "income_target": 500.00,
  "expense_limit": 200.00,
  "savings_target": 300.00,
  "notes": "Weekend target"
}

### Get All Daily Targets
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets?page=1&page_size=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Daily Targets with Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets?date_from=2025-10-01&date_to=2025-10-31 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Today's Target
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/today HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Current Month Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/month-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Week Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/week-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Daily Target by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Daily Target
PUT {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "income_target": 600.00,
  "expense_limit": 250.00,
  "savings_target": 350.00,
  "notes": "Updated weekend target"
}

### Refresh Actual Values
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1/refresh HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Daily Target
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### FINANCIAL GOALS API
### ============================================

### Create Financial Goal
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Emergency Fund",
  "description": "Build 6 months emergency fund",
  "target_amount": 30000.00,
  "current_amount": 5000.00,
  "start_date": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "target_date": "2025-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "category": "Savings",
  "priority": 2
}

### Create Financial Goal - Vacation
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Summer Vacation",
  "description": "Trip to Bali",
  "target_amount": 15000.00,
  "current_amount": 2000.00,
  "start_date": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "target_date": "2025-06-30T00:00:00Z",
  "category": "Travel",
  "priority": 1
}

### Get All Financial Goals
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals?page=1&page_size=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Active Goals Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals?is_completed=false HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Completed Goals
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals?is_completed=true HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get High Priority Goals
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals?priority=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Goals by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals?category=Savings HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Financial Goal by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Financial Goal
PUT {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Emergency Fund",
  "target_amount": 35000.00,
  "current_amount": 8000.00
}

### Update Goal Progress (Set Amount)
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals/1/update-progress HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 12000.00
}

### Add to Goal Progress
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals/1/add-progress HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 1000.00
}

### Get Goals Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals/summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Financial Goal
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### BACKTEST STRATEGY API
### ============================================

### Create Backtest Strategy - Investment
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Monthly Investment Plan",
  "description": "Invest $500 monthly with 8% annual return",
  "strategy_type": "investment",
  "initial_amount": 10000.00,
  "monthly_contribution": 500.00,
  "expected_return": 8.0,
  "duration": 60,
  "start_date": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Create Backtest Strategy - Savings
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "High-Yield Savings",
  "description": "Save $1000 monthly with 4% annual return",
  "strategy_type": "savings",
  "initial_amount": 5000.00,
  "monthly_contribution": 1000.00,
  "expected_return": 4.0,
  "duration": 36,
  "start_date": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Get All Backtest Strategies
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies?page=1&page_size=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Strategies by Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies?strategy_type=investment HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Strategies by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies?status=active HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Backtest Strategy by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Backtest Result
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies/1/result HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Backtest Strategy
PUT {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "monthly_contribution": 600.00,
  "expected_return": 9.0
}

### Run Backtest (Recalculate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies/1/run HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activate Strategy
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies/1/activate HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Complete Strategy
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies/1/complete HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "actual_amount": 75000.00
}

### Delete Backtest Strategy
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/finance/backtest-strategies/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### BUDGETS API
### ============================================

### Create Budget - Monthly
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "category": "Food & Dining",
  "amount": 3000.00,
  "period": "monthly",
  "start_date": "2025-10-01T00:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2025-10-31T23:59:59Z",
  "is_recurring": true
}

### Create Budget - Weekly
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "category": "Entertainment",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "period": "weekly",
  "start_date": "2025-10-19T00:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2025-10-25T23:59:59Z",
  "is_recurring": false
}

### Get All Budgets
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets?page=1&page_size=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Active Budgets Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets?is_active=true HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Budgets by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets?category=Food%20%26%20Dining HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Budgets by Period
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets?period=monthly HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Budget by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Budget
PUT {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 3500.00
}

### Get Budget Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Monthly Budget Report - Current Month
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/monthly-report HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Monthly Budget Report - Specific Month
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/monthly-report?year=2025&month=9 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check Budget Alerts - Default Threshold (80%)
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/alerts HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check Budget Alerts - Custom Threshold
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/alerts?threshold=90 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Budget
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### INTEGRATION SCENARIOS
### ============================================

### Scenario 1: Daily Financial Routine
### 1. Get today's target
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/today HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Add expense transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "category": "Food",
  "description": "Lunch",
  "date": "2025-10-19T12:00:00Z"
}

### 3. Refresh today's target
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1/refresh HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Check budget alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/alerts HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scenario 2: Monthly Review
### 1. Get transaction summary for the month
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/summary?date_from=2025-10-01&date_to=2025-10-31 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get category breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions/breakdown?type=expense&date_from=2025-10-01&date_to=2025-10-31 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get monthly budget report
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/budgets/monthly-report HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get goals summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals/summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get month summary for daily targets
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/month-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scenario 3: Goal Tracking
### 1. Add income transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/transactions HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "income",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "category": "Savings",
  "description": "Emergency fund contribution",
  "date": "2025-10-19T00:00:00Z"
}

### 2. Update goal progress
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals/1/add-progress HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 1000.00
}

### 3. Check goal status
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/goals/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
